  "summary": "Happy path: all 12 explorer steps matched the documentation (PASS). Adversarial: 10 of 12 tested rules held; 2 broke and were confirmed with curl on fresh data. overpayment_protection BREACHED: the API accepts invoices whose total exceeds received value when the overrun is via a higher unit_price (e.g. $2.02 invoiced vs $2.00 received on 2 units at $0.02 over; up to ~1% on large lines such as $101 vs $100 received)—money at risk is any excess that could be matched and approved into AP. partial_receipt_flag BREACHED: on a multi-line PO with the last line only partly received, match returned partial_receipt false despite received_value below ordered_value—risk is false confidence that delivery is complete before paying. No undocumented adversary outcomes."
